  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 46cdf555282730a418680dd33bbfefd8, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Greetings M''lady,

    I''ve been able to brave
    the seas thanks to your concoctions. I have arrived at a port where I met many
    soon to be mateys. Sadly though, one of them broke their boat''s mast and he''s
    stuck inland for the time being. Could you make some Sapglue for him?

    Cheers,'
